:.

:global
:wasm


// * Wasm functions have a fixed arity, so optional parameters are rejected.
:e
fun opt(x, y?) = x
opt(1)
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Optional parameters are not supported by the WebAssembly backend.
//│ ║  l.9: 	fun opt(x, y?) = x
//│ ╙──     	       ^^^^^^^

// FIXME: Trailing parameters are lowered into a rest parameter and calls to `Runtime.Tuple`,
// which the Wasm backend does not support; they should be rejected with a proper diagnostic.
:fixme
fun trailing(x, ...xs, y) = y
trailing(1, 2, 3)
